{"change_summary":"Added `docs/scientific_inventory.md` as the repo-local scientific inventory for the current simulator. The document now catalogs state pools, rate and hardcoded parameters, enforced vs missing invariants, known nonphysical shortcuts, storage-vs-display semantics, a 21-file test dependency map, and handoff pointers for `A2`/`A2c`, `B1`, `B2`, `B7`, `C1`, `D1`/`D2`, `E1`, `E4`, and `G1` follow-on beads.","outstanding_risks":["This stage only updated documentation; no code or tests changed, so later source changes can stale the inventory unless the note is kept in sync.","Some parameter families are grouped into shared catalog rows for readability; `G1` still needs a per-field provenance/unit inventory if machine-readable tracking is required.","The document records current semantics, including shortcuts and dormant fields, but it does not resolve those scientific issues; the downstream beads still need to implement the behavioral changes."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected `tank_core`, `tank_scenarios`, `tank_data`, and API sources to inventory current scientific state, units, invariants, snapshots, and tests.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Authored `docs/scientific_inventory.md` with the required pool catalog, rate/parameter catalog, invariant catalog, nonphysical-behavior list, and test dependency map.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Added explicit storage-vs-display guidance and downstream bead handoff references for `A2`/`A2c`, `B1`, `B2`, `B7`, `C1`, `D1`/`D2`, `E1`, `E4`, and `G1`.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Validated section coverage, current test-file count, and key source references after writing the document.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["Confirmed `docs/scientific_inventory.md` contains the required top-level sections with `rg -n '^## (1|2|3|4|5)\\\\.' docs/scientific_inventory.md`.","Confirmed the downstream handoff section exists with `rg -n '^## 6\\\\.' docs/scientific_inventory.md` and that `A2`/`A2c`, `B1`, `B2`, `B7`, `C1`, `D1`/`D2`, `E1`, `E4`, and `G1` are referenced in the file.","Verified the repository currently has 21 relevant test files with `ls crates/tank_core/tests/*.rs crates/tank_scenarios/tests/*.rs | wc -l` -> `21`, matching the test dependency map.","Cross-checked storage/display and chemistry naming notes against `crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs` and `crates/tank_api/src/handlers/snapshot.rs`, including the `nh3_mg_l` TAN-as-N ambiguity.","Cross-checked invariant coverage against `crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs`, including non-negativity checks, index clamping, geometry sanity, selected parameter validation, and event-log retention.","Cross-checked runtime coefficient notes against `crates/tank_core/src/types/process.rs` and `crates/tank_data/data/process/default.toml`, including the `ProcessParams::default()` vs shipped TOML DIC-rate mismatch.","Verified the working tree with `git status --short`; the doc file is present and the only other visible change is an unrelated pre-existing untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory."]}